{"1395930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Break The Chain", "steam_appid": 1395930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 TRAPPED. CHAINED. ONE MISTAKE PULLS EVERYONE DOWN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the Chain is a physics-based puzzle game where every step matters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are bound together — and your only goal is to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/c2b8262b4c0991abddc8db7873c46d3e.poster.avif?t=1783121608\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/c2b8262b4c0991abddc8db7873c46d3e.webm?t=1783121608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/c2b8262b4c0991abddc8db7873c46d3e.mp4?t=1783121608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 CORE GAMEPLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Physics-based challenges  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Precise movement and timing  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No combat — pure skill  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Every mistake has consequences  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the mechanics. Adapt to each obstacle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail… and start again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/10fd39a295fa728df4e8a057694c81b4.poster.avif?t=1783121608\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/10fd39a295fa728df4e8a057694c81b4.webm?t=1783121608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/10fd39a295fa728df4e8a057694c81b4.mp4?t=1783121608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 SOLO OR CO-OP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone and rely on your own precision…  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or jump into co-op and escape together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful — one wrong move can pull everyone down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication and coordination are the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/0851c35943b651a956e32122dec32f80.poster.avif?t=1783121608\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/0851c35943b651a956e32122dec32f80.webm?t=1783121608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/0851c35943b651a956e32122dec32f80.mp4?t=1783121608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ WHAT TO EXPECT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Environmental puzzles that test your thinking  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Increasing difficulty with every stage  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Tense, minimal atmosphere  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Progress that must be earned  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level pushes you further.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every success feels deserved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/2c120fd009940ef6555ac491ea5ac760.poster.avif?t=1783121608\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/2c120fd009940ef6555ac491ea5ac760.webm?t=1783121608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/2c120fd009940ef6555ac491ea5ac760.mp4?t=1783121608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 IT WON’T BE EASY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no shortcuts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No second chances mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only your skill… your patience… and your will to keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall — and you start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 YOUR GOAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the chain.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t fall.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t give up.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 TRAPPED. CHAINED. ONE MISTAKE PULLS EVERYONE DOWN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the Chain is a physics-based puzzle game where every step matters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are bound together — and your only goal is to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/c2b8262b4c0991abddc8db7873c46d3e.poster.avif?t=1783121608\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/c2b8262b4c0991abddc8db7873c46d3e.webm?t=1783121608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395930/extras/c2b8262b